  "id": "picrotoxin",
  "term": "picrotoxin",
  "definition": "Picrotoxin is a mixture of picrotoxinin and picrotin that blocks GABA-A receptor activity and can trigger convulsions. It has mainly been used as a research substance, but it has also been used as a central nervous system stimulant and as an antidote for poisoning by central nervous system depressants, especially barbiturates.",
